# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PhD GenAI — repository-wide .gitignore
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Code and documentation are committed; data is not.
#   1. Credentialed data (MIMIC-IV, MIMIC-IV-ED, MIMIC-IV-Note, eICU-CRD, Zigong HF):
#      the PhysioNet DUA forbids redistribution.
#   2. NHANES raw files: public, but re-downloaded and SHA256-verified by
#      01_data/download_nhanes.py instead of being stored here.
#   3. Patient-level derived rows (cleaned tables, per-person status, cohort
#      samples, model calls): regenerated by the scripts, never committed.
#   4. Copyrighted publisher material (papers, supplements, guideline full text).
# _archive/htn-concord/.gitignore keeps its own, stricter rules for that subtree.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1–2. Raw data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/01_data/raw/

# MIMIC-derived profiles (local only) and copyrighted references for 00_shared
/00_shared/data/
/00_shared/references/

# ── 3. Patient-level derived outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────
/01_data/nhanes_IJ/output/
/01_data/nhanes_IJ/model_input/*.csv
!/01_data/nhanes_IJ/model_input/prevent_coefficient_check.csv
/01_data/nhanes_IJ/audit/row_status.csv
/01_data/nhanes_IJ/review-2026-10-20/*.csv
/02_cv-llm/risk-extraction/feasibility/out/
/02_cv-llm/rulebench/pilot/out/*
!/02_cv-llm/rulebench/pilot/out/report.txt
!/02_cv-llm/rulebench/pilot/out/cohort_summary.json

# ── 4. Copyrighted material ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
/02_cv-llm/rulebench/artifacts/htn_guidelines.html

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
credentials.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Environments, caches, OS files ───────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
